WEBVTT

00:00:27.794 --> 00:00:29.762
Grampa...?

00:00:54.254 --> 00:00:57.485
| came to this land to protect you.

00:00:57.857 --> 00:01:01.054
| was born to be with you.

00:01:01.428 --> 00:01:04.398
The moment I awoke...

00:01:05.065 --> 00:01:08.524
...prisms surrounded me.

00:01:08.668 --> 00:01:12.104
I'm here to love you now.

00:01:12.472 --> 00:01:15.772
I was born to hold you.

00:01:15.975 --> 00:01:18.945
Lies and truths...

00:01:19.579 --> 00:01:23.072
...are all within ourselves.

00:01:23.950 --> 00:01:27.853
The days I abandon my true feelings...

00:01:28.221 --> 00:01:29.689
...won't get to me.

00:01:30.123 --> 00:01:33.423
Tenderness and caring...

00:01:33.793 --> 00:01:36.763
...can be ours once again!

00:01:37.130 --> 00:01:41.377
Day in, day out,
like a puppet on a string.

00:01:41.401 --> 00:01:45.247
Wandering in the void
between zero and infinity.

00:01:45.271 --> 00:01:48.617
The strength to sever
the tangled wires...

00:01:48.641 --> 00:01:53.374
...is still sleeping inside of you.

00:02:03.089 --> 00:02:06.389
Vexed at the series of failures
at the hands of the saber dolls...

00:02:06.459 --> 00:02:09.622
...Faust came up with a plan
to obliterate all of Japoness...

00:02:09.696 --> 00:02:13.564
...in one stroke, with the gigantic
floating weapon called the Sabelberg.

00:02:13.633 --> 00:02:17.399
Meanwhile, the saber dolls invaded
the under-guarded Castle Japoness...

00:02:17.470 --> 00:02:19.962
...on a mission to assassinate leyasu.

00:02:20.039 --> 00:02:22.804
By the time Otaru and the others
arrived, it was too late.

00:02:22.876 --> 00:02:26.039
Ieyasu had been cut down
by Tiger's blade.

00:02:27.013 --> 00:02:31.849
What will become of our heroes
and Japoness, now without a leader?!

00:02:36.489 --> 00:02:42.292
Castle, Transform!
Rise, Japonessguar!

00:02:45.031 --> 00:02:46.658
Grampa...

00:02:47.200 --> 00:02:49.168
Hey... What's wrong...?

00:02:50.203 --> 00:02:51.830
Open your eyes.

00:02:52.572 --> 00:02:54.438
Come on...

00:02:54.507 --> 00:02:56.908
Say something!

00:02:56.976 --> 00:02:58.444
Grampa...

00:03:00.346 --> 00:03:03.577
GRAMPA!M!

00:03:08.054 --> 00:03:10.148
The gigantic sphere that
appeared out of nowhere...

00:03:10.223 --> 00:03:12.851
...has been revealed to be
Gartlant's special assault weapon.

00:03:12.926 --> 00:03:14.985
However, our own division
of Orange Blossom sabers...

00:03:15.061 --> 00:03:17.189
...sent out to combat the menace...

00:03:17.564 --> 00:03:19.555
"Kasahari Apartments” ..were
wiped out by a team of red heads?!!

00:03:19.999 --> 00:03:20.932
Say what?!

00:03:24.904 --> 00:03:25.881
ALTA BLDG

00:03:25.905 --> 00:03:29.307
Unwavering, the gigantic sphere
continues to advance towards Japoness.

00:03:29.375 --> 00:03:31.901
It is only a matter of time
before it invades the city.

00:03:32.545 --> 00:03:34.980
God, save us all!
Save us all!

00:03:36.916 --> 00:03:38.714
Somebody, help us!!

00:03:58.004 --> 00:03:59.472
Shogun...

00:04:11.217 --> 00:04:12.685
Dammit...!

00:04:14.254 --> 00:04:16.188
Master Otaru, where
are you going?

00:04:18.024 --> 00:04:20.391
The Shogun won't rest
in peace like this.

00:04:20.960 --> 00:04:22.792
This is the city he built...

00:04:22.862 --> 00:04:24.853
This is our Japoness,
and I'm going to protect it"

00:04:25.398 --> 00:04:28.493
But, protecting it
would be impossible...!

00:04:31.037 --> 00:04:32.505
We're going with him!

00:04:36.876 --> 00:04:38.344
Coming, Lime?!

00:04:39.445 --> 00:04:40.913
No.

00:04:42.348 --> 00:04:46.376
We were going to light
the firecracker together.

00:04:46.953 --> 00:04:49.888
He said we were going to light
the firecracker together...

00:04:49.956 --> 00:04:51.446
He...

00:04:51.524 --> 00:04:54.824
He promised me!!

00:04:58.097 --> 00:05:00.964
Stupid! This isn't the
time for this nonsense!

00:05:01.034 --> 00:05:02.934
That's right! If
you don't get moving...

00:05:03.002 --> 00:05:05.937
...Otaru could end up
just like the Shogun here!

00:05:06.005 --> 00:05:07.473
He could?!

00:05:11.944 --> 00:05:14.436
This is Tiger.
Our mission is complete.

00:05:15.148 --> 00:05:17.116
We will return there shortly.

00:05:19.886 --> 00:05:22.719
Without a leader,
Japoness is as good as ours.

00:05:22.989 --> 00:05:27.085
Very well done, Tiger.
Your Lord Faust must be ecstatic.

00:05:27.493 --> 00:05:29.962
...almost as ecstatic
to hear that as I am.

00:05:30.830 --> 00:05:32.298
That disgusting little toad.

00:05:35.034 --> 00:05:37.093
- What is it, Luchs?
- I see someone...

00:05:37.937 --> 00:05:39.496
...up there.

00:05:42.375 --> 00:05:43.843
It's him!

00:05:47.013 --> 00:05:49.846
I don't care whether it's filled with
explosives or little toys and candies!

00:05:49.916 --> 00:05:52.476
I'm going to make this into
the Shogun's avenging battle!

00:05:52.552 --> 00:05:55.954
Before it can lay waste to the city,
I'll lay waste to IT!

00:06:01.427 --> 00:06:03.555
It's you!

00:06:03.629 --> 00:06:06.462
What do you think you
can accomplish up here?

00:06:06.532 --> 00:06:09.194
Surely you don't think
you can stop the Sabelberg...

00:06:09.268 --> 00:06:11.032
...all by yourself?

00:06:11.104 --> 00:06:14.165
Screw of " I'll never
know if I don't TRY!

00:06:14.240 --> 00:06:16.675
Now, get the hell
out of my way"

00:06:16.743 --> 00:06:19.576
| seriously doubt you'll make any
difference, one way or the other.

00:06:19.645 --> 00:06:22.273
Still, be it even one lousy insect...

00:06:22.615 --> 00:06:24.913
...those who defy Lord Faust...

00:06:24.984 --> 00:06:26.474
...must DIEM

00:06:29.489 --> 00:06:30.979
Otarul

00:06:40.400 --> 00:06:41.834
Damn!

00:06:41.901 --> 00:06:43.528
Lime!

00:06:43.603 --> 00:06:45.799
You aren't going to have it your way!

00:06:45.872 --> 00:06:48.864
We will protect Master Otaru!

00:06:48.941 --> 00:06:50.500
Cherry! Bloodberry!

00:06:51.010 --> 00:06:54.002
Otaru, Otaru! Are you okay?!
Can you still move??!

00:06:54.080 --> 00:06:56.276
Are you in pain?
Tell me, Otaru!

00:06:57.150 --> 00:06:59.881
It takes more
than that to hurt me!

00:06:59.952 --> 00:07:01.852
Otaru...! Thank goodness!

00:07:04.090 --> 00:07:06.616
HEY, YOU! You picked
on Otaru, didn't you!!

00:07:08.161 --> 00:07:10.186
I'll make you SORRY!!

00:07:11.964 --> 00:07:14.695
| think the time has
come to settle this.

00:07:26.979 --> 00:07:29.471
It appears that the saber dolls
have encountered Lime...

00:07:29.549 --> 00:07:32.985
...and the other Japoness sabers.
Shall I call them back?

00:07:33.252 --> 00:07:34.447
Don't bother.

00:07:34.520 --> 00:07:37.182
After all, they are expendable,
at the end of their usefulness.

00:07:37.256 --> 00:07:40.715
They would find it an honor to
be obliterated along with Japoness.

00:07:45.364 --> 00:07:46.854
Plasma!

00:07:46.933 --> 00:07:49.231
This is bad! Guys, we
have to get out of here!

00:07:49.302 --> 00:07:50.861
But, Otaru...

00:07:51.103 --> 00:07:54.437
It's PLASMA! You'll all be
in danger if you stay here!

00:07:54.507 --> 00:07:55.997
We have to take cover NOW!

00:07:56.075 --> 00:07:57.634
There's no way around it.

00:07:58.311 --> 00:07:59.904
We'll finish this later!

00:07:59.979 --> 00:08:01.447
Not so fast!!

00:08:05.651 --> 00:08:07.915
What, you're going to run away
after we've come so far?

00:08:07.987 --> 00:08:09.512
That's no fun!

00:08:10.590 --> 00:08:13.457
You stupid twit! This isn't
the time for this nonsense!

00:08:13.893 --> 00:08:17.887
If either us or that bomb gets hit
by lightning, we're all toast!

00:08:17.964 --> 00:08:19.625
Your plan has failed!

00:08:21.534 --> 00:08:22.968
"Failed"?

00:08:24.670 --> 00:08:26.160
Did you think that a little plasma...

00:08:26.239 --> 00:08:28.833
...could zap away Lord Faust's
ultimate goal, just like that?

00:08:28.908 --> 00:08:30.034
WHAT?

00:08:30.109 --> 00:08:31.736
Master Otaru, LOOK"

00:08:41.087 --> 00:08:42.248
Say what?!!

00:08:46.592 --> 00:08:48.060
Th-That's impossible...!

00:08:51.597 --> 00:08:55.227
Fools. We've already created
a system which can harness...

00:08:55.301 --> 00:08:58.202
...and use plasma
as an energy source.

00:08:59.238 --> 00:09:00.899
In other words, Japoness is doomed...

00:09:00.973 --> 00:09:03.499
...no matter HOW much you struggle!

00:09:03.910 --> 00:09:05.435
And, so are you.

00:09:06.646 --> 00:09:08.114
Lime!

00:09:41.514 --> 00:09:42.913
Crap...!

00:09:42.982 --> 00:09:45.041
What the hell happened...?!

00:09:46.886 --> 00:09:48.877
Lime... Where's Lime?!

00:09:53.059 --> 00:09:54.527
Lime!!

00:09:57.229 --> 00:09:58.253
Oh, shit!

00:09:58.331 --> 00:09:59.992
Looks like I win.

00:10:01.667 --> 00:10:03.431
Now, it's over!

00:10:03.502 --> 00:10:05.027
WHAT?!

00:10:05.638 --> 00:10:07.504
What're you trying to pull?!

00:10:07.573 --> 00:10:10.042
I've had enough!
| won't let you.

00:10:10.509 --> 00:10:14.002
I'll be damned if I'm going to lose
anything else that's important to me

00:10:14.080 --> 00:10:15.673
Important...?!

00:10:22.054 --> 00:10:23.852
Yes.

00:10:23.923 --> 00:10:27.223
I have something that
is important to me, too.

00:10:40.973 --> 00:10:44.068
I don't want to
lose his wishes...

00:10:44.143 --> 00:10:46.043
...his love!

00:10:46.112 --> 00:10:47.841
That is why...

00:10:47.913 --> 00:10:49.813
.JHAVE TO GET RID OF YOou

00:10:50.483 --> 00:10:51.951
Master Otarul

00:10:55.855 --> 00:10:57.949
Don't, Otaru... Move!

00:10:58.024 --> 00:10:59.788
You have to, or...

00:11:01.927 --> 00:11:04.021
...OR YOU'LL DIE"!

00:11:39.031 --> 00:11:40.499
You have to die!

00:11:41.000 --> 00:11:43.128
Don't, Otaru... Move!

00:11:43.202 --> 00:11:44.966
You have to...

00:11:45.037 --> 00:11:46.937
...OR YOU'LL DIE"!

00:11:53.713 --> 00:11:56.205
| am a beast of a man.

00:11:56.649 --> 00:11:59.277
Let us have faith in them.

00:11:59.351 --> 00:12:02.218
The faith that they will pave
the way for a new generation.

00:12:12.031 --> 00:12:13.863
What?! Something is
heading this way!

00:12:33.953 --> 00:12:35.421
Hey...

00:12:37.990 --> 00:12:39.856
Tamasaburo! Baiko!

00:12:39.925 --> 00:12:40.915
Otaru!

00:12:40.993 --> 00:12:42.483
Y-Yes, sir!

00:12:42.995 --> 00:12:46.863
I'm now convinced that
your spirit is genuine!

00:12:46.932 --> 00:12:49.196
We will look after matters here!

00:12:49.268 --> 00:12:51.362
- Those voices...
- GRAMPA?!

00:12:51.670 --> 00:12:53.104
And Mr. Hikozaemon!

00:12:53.405 --> 00:12:54.930
THAT'S leyasu?!

00:12:55.007 --> 00:12:56.338
It can't be!

00:12:56.408 --> 00:12:58.877
But, how?!
Grampa, you're alive!

00:12:59.879 --> 00:13:02.280
This is a borrowed life.
In a worst-case scenario...

00:13:02.348 --> 00:13:05.579
...our memories and thought patterns
were set to be fed into these bodies.

00:13:05.651 --> 00:13:07.119
Nothing more!

00:13:07.586 --> 00:13:12.387
We are only back to complete
the work we left unfinished.

00:13:13.859 --> 00:13:15.953
| will explain it to you
in detail later, Otaru.

00:13:16.028 --> 00:13:19.965
You can't fight with those wounds.
Take everyone back to the castle!

00:13:21.534 --> 00:13:23.002
B-But...

00:13:24.703 --> 00:13:29.470
The final means to save Japoness is
hidden in the garden behind the castle.

00:13:29.542 --> 00:13:31.340
The keyword, is...

00:13:31.410 --> 00:13:33.936
"CHECKMATE, FORK ROOK™

00:13:34.013 --> 00:13:35.276
Checkmate, fork rook?!

00:13:35.915 --> 00:13:38.475
We will take care
of THEM. Now, go!

00:13:38.551 --> 00:13:40.918
R-Right! Can you run, Lime?

00:13:40.986 --> 00:13:41.475
Yes!

00:13:41.554 --> 00:13:43.955
Good. Cherry! Bloodberry!

00:13:44.824 --> 00:13:46.656
- I'll do my best!
- I'm with you, boss!

00:13:46.992 --> 00:13:48.460
Good, now let's go!

00:13:49.895 --> 00:13:51.192
Hold it"

00:13:51.263 --> 00:13:53.823
WE will entertain you
in their absence.

00:13:53.899 --> 00:13:56.891
Don't jerk me around" Out of
the way, you talking corpses!

00:13:58.003 --> 00:14:00.097
This is what must be done
to bring in the new generation.

00:14:00.172 --> 00:14:03.403
For now, we must swallow
our pride, and fight you.

00:14:06.011 --> 00:14:07.479
Damn you!

00:14:30.002 --> 00:14:30.745
ALTA BLDG

00:14:30.769 --> 00:14:33.500
The gigantic sphere has begun an
indiscriminate attack on the city.

00:14:33.572 --> 00:14:36.007
All citizens, please
evacuate immediately.

00:14:39.411 --> 00:14:42.779
Crap! It's no good!
We'll never get through here!

00:14:43.616 --> 00:14:46.176
We'll have to take the back roads!

00:14:46.252 --> 00:14:48.914
Hey, Otaru? What's at the castle?

00:14:48.988 --> 00:14:49.853
I don't know.

00:14:49.922 --> 00:14:52.016
What did he mean by
"checkmate, fork rook"?

00:14:52.091 --> 00:14:55.152
| DON'T KNOW!
But that's what the Shogun said.

00:14:55.628 --> 00:14:57.596
We'll just have to go
there and find out!

00:14:59.531 --> 00:15:01.761
Hey, that was Otaru!

00:15:01.834 --> 00:15:03.802
Looks like he's heading
for the castle.

00:15:04.270 --> 00:15:05.738
Yeah!

00:15:14.313 --> 00:15:16.179
W-What's this?!

00:15:17.283 --> 00:15:19.945
It looks kind of like
Grampa's favorite game.

00:15:20.586 --> 00:15:22.397
The Shogun's favorite game?

00:15:22.421 --> 00:15:24.048
Silver - Gold - King - Gold - Silver

00:15:24.123 --> 00:15:25.648
Pawn - Pawn - Pawn
Rook

00:15:25.724 --> 00:15:27.419
Enemy rook
Pawn - Pawn

00:15:27.927 --> 00:15:29.895
But, what's it doing HERE...?

00:15:31.430 --> 00:15:34.832
It is my educated guess that this
is a classic "rook to center” move.

00:15:35.634 --> 00:15:37.932
The attacked king probably
represents Castle Japoness...

00:15:38.003 --> 00:15:41.906
...and the enemy rook, going for
a frontal attack, is the enemy bomb.

00:15:41.974 --> 00:15:43.442
Hanagata, you jerk!!

00:15:43.509 --> 00:15:45.841
0-Otaru, what'd I do?!

00:15:46.378 --> 00:15:47.903
Tell me, Hanagata!

00:15:47.980 --> 00:15:51.075
How do I protect the
king from their rook?!

00:15:51.850 --> 00:15:52.928
Enemy rook
Pawn - Pawn - Pawn

00:15:52.952 --> 00:15:54.829
Enemy rook Pawn - Pawn - Pawn The basic
strategy behind shogi is defense, Otaru!

00:15:54.853 --> 00:15:55.877
The basic strategy behind
shogi is defense, Otaru!

00:15:55.955 --> 00:15:59.016
Drop a gold piece on position 5-8
to strengthen your defenses!

00:16:00.059 --> 00:16:04.087
That's easy for you to say!
Lifting this thing is MURDER!

00:16:05.564 --> 00:16:07.032
| can't get any power into it!

00:16:08.968 --> 00:16:11.369
Damn! If only I wasn't damaged...!

00:16:13.572 --> 00:16:15.199
"Gold General”

00:16:16.909 --> 00:16:18.934
Honestly! It's impossible
to watch you bunglers!

00:16:19.211 --> 00:16:20.542
Hey, it's you!!

00:16:20.612 --> 00:16:22.603
Reinforcements are here, Otaru!

00:16:23.949 --> 00:16:25.815
All right! Let's do it

00:16:26.552 --> 00:16:28.179
HEAVE-HOM

00:16:38.197 --> 00:16:39.562
W-W-What's that?!

00:16:39.631 --> 00:16:43.431
Hey, guys! Otaru Mamiya
is up to something again!

00:16:43.502 --> 00:16:44.298
He is?!

00:16:44.370 --> 00:16:46.862
They're saying that THE Otaru
Mamiya is up to something again!

00:16:46.939 --> 00:16:49.306
Yeah, and this time, he's trying to
bring out the Shogun's secret weapon!

00:16:49.975 --> 00:16:52.808
If we don't go to help out, we won't
deserve to be called men of Japoness!

00:16:53.212 --> 00:16:55.271
It is said that attack
is the greatest defense!

00:16:55.347 --> 00:16:58.806
Everyone, secure the path
for the bishop, and ATTACK!

00:16:59.051 --> 00:17:00.815
Take that™

00:17:28.047 --> 00:17:31.073
What IS that?
What is that they are doing?

00:17:31.150 --> 00:17:32.982
It's probably just a
last, desperate struggle.

00:17:33.252 --> 00:17:34.879
Go, Otaru!

00:17:34.953 --> 00:17:37.479
The "checkmate, fork rook” move
will turn the game around!!

00:17:47.132 --> 00:17:48.531
Oh, my god!

00:17:48.600 --> 00:17:50.329
H-Holy crap!

00:17:56.575 --> 00:17:59.442
That's so cool! The castle
turned into a giant robot!

00:17:59.511 --> 00:18:02.208
Castle Robo, Japonessguar!

00:18:02.581 --> 00:18:03.980
Say what?!

00:18:04.650 --> 00:18:08.348
GO, JAPONESSGUAR!
Save Japoness!

00:18:18.897 --> 00:18:24.927
With the same foolishness as
walking blindly into a maze...

00:18:26.271 --> 00:18:30.970
...satisfied with a world
containing only heartache.

00:18:31.977 --> 00:18:33.445
What?!

00:18:34.680 --> 00:18:36.546
Now, Hikozaemon!!

00:18:36.615 --> 00:18:38.105
WHAT?!

00:18:40.752 --> 00:18:44.086
Forever chasing after...

00:18:44.957 --> 00:18:47.722
...an endless dream.

00:18:48.927 --> 00:18:50.395
It's being pushed back!

00:18:51.830 --> 00:18:55.027
All the day, all the night,
all the time.

00:18:57.269 --> 00:18:58.737
- Damn!
- It's not working!

00:18:59.138 --> 00:19:02.472
It's a truth which never lets go.

00:19:03.542 --> 00:19:07.240
Break down darkness...

00:19:07.312 --> 00:19:11.408
Break it through the thunder!

00:19:15.954 --> 00:19:17.547
It's still there!

00:19:17.823 --> 00:19:21.282
OKAY! Don't let it beat you,
Japonessguar! Hit it again'!

00:19:53.926 --> 00:19:55.690
That can't be!

00:19:56.094 --> 00:19:57.687
Now, finish it"!

00:20:07.272 --> 00:20:09.036
My Krabbensteif division!!

00:20:09.107 --> 00:20:10.973
Commander Goddel!
We must evacuate!

00:20:28.527 --> 00:20:30.017
D...Did we do it?

00:20:30.095 --> 00:20:32.894
We did it" We did it, Otaru!

00:20:32.965 --> 00:20:34.933
Japoness is saved!

00:20:37.169 --> 00:20:38.967
In your face, Gartlant!

00:20:39.037 --> 00:20:40.937
Japonessguar, BANZAI!

00:20:42.874 --> 00:20:44.035
You did good, guys!

00:20:44.109 --> 00:20:46.942
- It was nothing.
- Somehow, we did it.

00:20:48.380 --> 00:20:50.542
And we owe it all to Grampa!

00:20:50.616 --> 00:20:52.243
Oh, yeah...

00:20:54.052 --> 00:20:58.751
Hey, Otaru? Why did Grampa
turn into Tamasaburo?

00:21:01.293 --> 00:21:03.455
I'm not clear on that one myself.

00:21:03.528 --> 00:21:06.862
But, it means that
he's still alive!

00:21:06.932 --> 00:21:08.900
That's great!!

00:21:08.967 --> 00:21:10.435
Yeah!

00:21:21.747 --> 00:21:22.441
Shogun...

00:21:22.514 --> 00:21:25.506
Yes... It appears that
both Cherry and Bloodberry...

00:21:25.584 --> 00:21:27.712
...have reached the final stage.

00:21:54.579 --> 00:21:58.311
When you're sad, when you're blue...

00:21:58.383 --> 00:22:02.047
...don't go off to be alone.

00:22:02.187 --> 00:22:05.088
Just think of me...

00:22:05.157 --> 00:22:09.719
...and I'll be there with you.

00:22:09.961 --> 00:22:13.761
Strength is a very important thing...

00:22:13.832 --> 00:22:17.462
...but tears are important, too.

00:22:17.636 --> 00:22:21.402
You can't do anything at all...

00:22:21.473 --> 00:22:23.168
...with a dried-up heart.

00:22:23.241 --> 00:22:27.200
You can't feel a thing.

00:22:29.314 --> 00:22:31.646
Tell me, why do people hide...

00:22:31.717 --> 00:22:36.678
...what they really feel inside?

00:22:36.855 --> 00:22:40.485
Take what you can do,
what you want to do...

00:22:40.692 --> 00:22:44.322
...one step at a time.

00:22:44.596 --> 00:22:48.226
I love the way you don't care...

00:22:48.300 --> 00:22:52.032
...how you have been
programmed to live.

00:22:52.170 --> 00:22:55.697
| would follow you anywhere.

00:22:56.074 --> 00:23:02.070
I'll never, ever let you go.

00:23:11.123 --> 00:23:12.284
Yoo-hoo! It's me, Lime!

00:23:12.357 --> 00:23:17.386
Otaru's going to repair us!
We really are lucky to have him!

00:23:17.662 --> 00:23:19.892
The saber dolls are attacking!

00:23:19.965 --> 00:23:21.933
But, I think something's
wrong with them...

00:23:22.000 --> 00:23:24.469
Why do they look so sad?

00:23:24.536 --> 00:23:27.028
It hurts...
It hurts inside my heart!

00:23:27.105 --> 00:23:29.369
Let's stop the fighting...
Please, Tiger??!

00:23:30.041 --> 00:23:31.552
Next on Saber Marionette J!

00:23:31.576 --> 00:23:33.788
Tiger: To The End Of Love, And
Beyond" Next on Saber Marionette J!

00:23:33.812 --> 00:23:36.008
Tiger: To The End Of Love,
And Beyond" I love you, Otaru!
